  <ThingDef ParentName="HelghastArmorMachineableBase">
    <defName>Apparel_HG_Cold_Grenweb</defName>
    <label>Helghan Cold-Weather Tank Hunter Rigging</label>
    <description>Helghan Tank-Hunter units were organized in such a way that it was assumed that they may need to operate as solo individuals, rather than actual loader/operator teams like the ISA. For this reason every specialist was loaded down with additional munitions and even a replacement tube or alternate launch system fixed onto their backs. ISA snipers would later remember to hunt the 'stove-pipes' or 'smoke-stacks' first in a helghan platoon if they were covering their own armor. Still, even if it made them easier targets, the doctrine paid off, with lone helghan anti tank ambushers whittling down ISA mechanized units, especially during the dense urban fighting around Pyrrhus.\n\nThis rigging has been cold-weather proofed</description>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <recipeMaker>
      <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedMetallicTechArmor</unfinishedThingDef>
      <researchPrerequisite>FlakArmor</researchPrerequisite>
      <skillRequirements>
